    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><fw place="top" type="letterhead">ALBION COLLEGE <lb/><rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__829" type="place">ALBION</rs>, <rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__755" type="place"
                            >MICHIGAN</rs></fw><dateline><date when="1946-01-24">Jan. 24,
                            1946</date></dateline><salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928"
                            type="person">Professor Tillich</rs>,</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>Kindly allow me this note to tell you how much I enjoyed your Ann Arbor lectures.
                    They were profound in thought and brilliantly clean. Persons everywhere with
                    whom I talked regarded hearing you a searching and blest experience.</p>
                <closer><salute>Very sincerely yours,</salute><signed><rs
                            ref="#tillich_person_id__147" type="person">Henry
                        Battenhouse</rs><lb/>(English Dept. Chairman)</signed>
                </closer>
                <fw place="bottom" type="adress">810 Mich. Ave.,<lb/><rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__829" type="place">Albion</rs>, <rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__755" type="place">Mich.</rs></fw>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
